# pdf-fidelity-engine

Host-independent PDF form truth extractor, GDI/HWP char-level text normalizer,
dashed-rule table grid builder, selective VLM slot text refiner port, and visual parity verifier.

## Pipeline

1. **Extract & Normalize (`extract`)**: Extracts `rawdict` `CharAtom`s, strips Faux-Bold multi-strike duplicates (promoting `bold=True`), re-sorts characters strictly by `(baseline, char.x0)` to undo font-batched backtracking, and restores missing word spaces from horizontal gaps.
2. **Layout (`layout`)**: Stitches broken dashed border segments (`0.6px+`) into table dividers, attaches cell fill shading (`bgColor`) and heading underlines, plans reading blocks, and renders clean `.vdoc` slot HTML without destructive negative `margin-left` rewinds.
3. **Selective Text Refine (`refine`)**: Detects slots containing missing-`/ToUnicode` symbols, PUA glyphs, or unspaced text runs and delegates only those bounding boxes via `SlotTextRefinerPort`.
4. **Verify (`verify`)**: Measures pixel parity (MuPDF vs PDFium noise floor / browser CDP capture) and generates `L-xx` tuning prescriptions.
